    - Term: Add 1 tray to continue!
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Add <color=#1AA41D>1 tray</color> to continue!
      - "Th\xEAm <color=#1AA41D>1 khay</color> \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c!"
      - "\u6DFB\u52A0<color=#1AA41D>1\u4E2A\u6258\u76D8</color>\u4EE5\u7EE7\u7EED\uFF01"
      - "\uACC4\uC18D\uD558\uB824\uBA74 <color=#1AA41D>\uD2B8\uB808\uC774 1\uAC1C</color>\uB97C
        \uCD94\uAC00\uD558\uC138\uC694!"
      - "<color=#1AA41D>\u30C8\u30EC\u30A4\u30921\u3064</color>\u8FFD\u52A0\u3057\u3066\u7D9A\u884C\uFF01"
      - Adicione <color=#1AA41D>1 bandeja</color> para continuar!
      - "\xA1Agrega <color=#1AA41D>1 bandeja</color> para continuar!"
      - Tambahkan <color=#1AA41D>1 baki</color> untuk melanjutkan!
      - "Devam etmek i\xE7in <color=#1AA41D>1 tepsi</color> ekleyin!"
      - "F\xFCge <color=#1AA41D>1 Tablett</color> zum Fortfahren hinzu!"
      - "Ajoutez <color=#1AA41D>1 plateau</color> pour continuer\_!"
      - Aggiungi <color=#1AA41D>1 vassoio</color> per continuare!
      - "\u0414\u043E\u0431\u0430\u0432\u044C\u0442\u0435 <color=#1AA41D>1 \u043F\u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0441</color>,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0434\u043E\u043B\u0436\u0438\u0442\u044C!"
      - "\u0E40\u0E1E\u0E34\u0E48\u0E21 <color=#1AA41D>1 \u0E16\u0E32\u0E14</color>
        \u0E40\u0E1E\u0E37\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E14\u0E33\u0E40\u0E19\u0E34\u0E19\u0E01\u0E32\u0E23\u0E15\u0E48\u0E2D!"
      - "<color=#1AA41D>1 \u091F\u094D\u0930\u0947</color> \u091C\u094B\u0921\u093C\u0947\u0902
        \u091C\u093E\u0930\u0940 \u0930\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093F\u090F!"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Add Plate!
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Add Plate!
      - "Th\xEAm \u0111\u0129a!"
      - "\u6DFB\u52A0\u76D8\u5B50\uFF01"
      - "\uC811\uC2DC \uCD94\uAC00!"
      - "\u76BF\u3092\u8FFD\u52A0\uFF01"
      - Adicionar prato!
      - "\xA1Agregar plato!"
